    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a strategy tower defense game with random elements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/a3f96e57b9d5348889982fbb5000cccd.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/a3f96e57b9d5348889982fbb5000cccd.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/a3f96e57b9d5348889982fbb5000cccd.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/0f89a998645a0c72e922f5552288a1f4.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/0f89a998645a0c72e922f5552288a1f4.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/0f89a998645a0c72e922f5552288a1f4.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enemies are no longer mindlessly advancing but launching organized attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to your tank's health, adjust formations, and devise strategies to withstand enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/36df6db29ea2b6c6a584997b40e2c760.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/36df6db29ea2b6c6a584997b40e2c760.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/36df6db29ea2b6c6a584997b40e2c760.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hundreds of different skills are randomized. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your build promptly based on acquired skills to tackle various levels effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flexible Formation Layout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/d3dc4d3f68cd129eaf985742dc765f3c.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/d3dc4d3f68cd129eaf985742dc765f3c.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/d3dc4d3f68cd129eaf985742dc765f3c.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each defense tower has a formation skill influencing surrounding units, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while also being affected by nearby units, resulting in dynamic layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-based Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/8dc01e95f5c7d008cca1bbb6b1734396.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/8dc01e95f5c7d008cca1bbb6b1734396.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/8dc01e95f5c7d008cca1bbb6b1734396.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Preparation Phase allows leisurely arrangement of formations and strategic deployment according to your preferences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Phase puts your strategy to the test, requiring constant attention to the battlefield. Demonstrate decisive actions at key positions and moments.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a strategy tower defense game with random elements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/a3f96e57b9d5348889982fbb5000cccd.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/a3f96e57b9d5348889982fbb5000cccd.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/a3f96e57b9d5348889982fbb5000cccd.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/0f89a998645a0c72e922f5552288a1f4.poster.avif?t=1738590210\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/0f89a998645a0c72e922f5552288a1f4.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/0f89a998645a0c72e922f5552288a1f4.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enemies are no longer mindlessly advancing but launching organized attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to your tank's health, adjust formations, and devise strategies to withstand enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/36df6db29ea2b6c6a584