e95f5c7d008cca1bbb6b1734396.webm?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581240/extras/8dc01e95f5c7d008cca1bbb6b1734396.mp4?t=1738590210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Preparation Phase allows leisurely arrangement of formations and strategic deployment according to your preferences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Phase puts your strategy to the test, requiring constant attention to the battlefield. Demonstrate decisive actions at key positions and moments.</p>",
